Package: openneuro
Title: Client for the OpenNeuro Database
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Dany", "Mukesha", , "danymukesha@gmail.com", 
            role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-9514-751X"))
Description: Search, explore, and download datasets from OpenNeuro
    (<https://openneuro.org/>) using its GraphQL API. Provides
    tidyverse-friendly access to BIDS neuroimaging datasets, including
    metadata search, file listing, selective download, and local
    caching. Supports repository-agnostic queries via a 'bids_*'
    interface for future backends.
